 "strings": {
  "Heheheh...": "",
  "Whaaat?": "",
  "Hmm...": "",
  "Oof.": "",
  "Well, that's no good.": "",
  "This is no good...": "",
  "Looking good.": "",
  "All right!": "",
  "Go easy on me.": "",
  "Thank you.": "",
  "Grr...": "",
  "Let's just see how this goes.": "",
  "This is... rough.": "",
  "Oh, well...": "",
  "Oh, fine.": "",
  "Thanks a bunch!": "",
  "Feelin' good!": "",
  "Yes!": "",
  "Yeah!": "",
  "Heh...": "",
  "How's it going?": "",
  "No holding back this time.": "",
  "This is <i>not</i> working.": "",
  "Hooray!": "",
  "I recommend the tempura!": "",
  "How about kitsune for you!": "",
  "You've got to try the tanuki!": "",
  "Care to sample the tsukimi?": "",
  "Let's drink.": "",
  "That's gone to my head...": "",
  "Isn't it your turn?": "",
  "You can still drink?": "",
  "No need to push it, all right?": "",
  "Wow, well done.": "",
  "That's a damn fine drink.": "",
  "Damn it.": "",
  "Damn. Can't believe it.": "",
  "This is a man's beauty!": "",
  "Full power!": "",
  "I'm not through yet!": "",
  "I can go all night!": "",
  "I think I'm spent...": "",
  "Let's get cooking.": "",
  "Right, here we go.": "",
  "Come on, then!": "",
  "That was delicious!": "",
  "Ahh! I think... that might be it for me.": "",
  "Don't mind if I do.": "",
  "I might be a little tipsy.": "",
  "Looks like I lost.": "",
  "Aw, no good.": "",
  "Darn it!": "",
  "Okay, it's your turn.": "",
  "I'm not tired!": "",
  "You hold your drink well.": "",
  "You're quite the drinker.": "",
  "I did it!": "",
  "I won!": "",
  "I'm holding you to your promise, you know.": "",
  "My oh my!": "",
  "Well, well...": "",
  "You're good at this.": "",
  "I'm in trouble.": "",
  "Embarrassing...": "",
  "Tsk. Stop staring, got it?": "",
  "Hello there.": "",
  "That's soothing.": "",
  "Coming on awful strong...": "",
  "Nice muscles.": "",
  "Feel like having some fun?": "",
  "Oh! That's neat...": "",
  "You're the best at this...": "",
  "I've never felt this way before...": "",
  "Ah! N-Not there...": "",
  "I'm feeling a little shy...": "",
  "Hey, keep your hands to yourself.": "",
  "That's intense...": "",
  "You samurai are as good as they say.": "",
  "You're gonna wear me out!": "",
  "You're good at this...": "",
  "Oh! I can't stand it anymore.": "",
  "You're so good with your hands.": "",
  "A bit... Go a bit harder...": "",
  "These muscles... I've never felt a body like yours before.": "",
  "I can't believe how big and strong your arms are...": "",
  "You're too strong! Be careful with me.": "",
  "It hurts a little, but it feels good... Don't stop.": "",
  "Oh my, you're amazing. So manly...": "",
  "Ah! I'm almost there! I feel faint!": "",
  "It feels so good... I might pass out...": "",
  "You know just how to care for me...": "",
  "So, you handle women as well as you handle your sword.": "",
  "I'm still a little drunk. Stay with me a little longer?": "",
  "Mmm. My body feels so warm...": "",
  "Maybe it's the sake, but I'm still burning up inside.": "",
  "I want you to show me a good time again...": "",
  "Can you go for another round? Please, for cute little Anna?": "",
  "Not quite enough. Let's see if you can get the job done...": "",
  "If you really work hard, I might give you a special treat.": "",
  "I still can't clear my head...": "",
  "There's no need to hold back, you know...": "",
  "Hey... Is there anyone special in your life?": "",
  "It's a lucky girl who gets to spend time with you.": "",
  "Hm? Oh... It's nothing.": "",
  "Don't stare like that! It's embarrassing.": "",
  "Is it me or is it a little too bright in here?": "",
  "Women get shy sometimes, you know...": "",
  "Oh... What's this now?": "",
  "You're done so soon? That's too bad.": "",
  "Hm? Is it over? That was quick.": "",
  "Were you not feeling well?": "",
  "Well... I suppose we all have off-days.": "",
  "That was... wonderful. Oh, you're the <i>best</i>.": "",
  "That was really good... You're amazing at this.": "",
  "You really are incredible... Thanks for a wonderful time.": "",
  "I'll show you the spirit of Japan!": "",
  "Let's make this flower bloom.": "",
  "Everyone, lose yourselves in my dance!": "",
  "Flower dance!": "",
  "Bloom, bright and beautiful!": "",
  "This is real buyo!": "",
  "Tsk, inelegant.": "",
  "What do you think?": "",
  "A perfect dance, if I do say so myself.": "",
  "Stupid...": "",
  "Doing well.": "",
  "All right, keep this up.": "",
  "Riichi.": "",
  "Double riichi.": "",
  "Saito-san.": "",
  "Uncle Hajime.": "",
  "Okay, here goes.": "",
  "I've got your back, okay?": "",
  "Have a good day!": "",
  "Well, good night, Uncle Hajime.": "",
  "Oh... You're the man from before.": "",
  "Mother": "",
  "Do you not remember me?": "",
  "You saved us when I had to take my daughter to see the doctor.": "",
  "I heard the joshi snatched you up...": "",
  "I'm glad to see you're safe!": "",
  "My daughter managed to recover from her illness.": "",
  "I can't thank you enough for what you did...": "",
  "You know, here in Tosa... The joshi... How do I say this?": "",
  "They just don't treat us like human beings.": "",
  "So sad to think when my child grows up,": "",
  "nothing will have changed.": "",
  "This land would be so much better off": "",
  "if people like you became joshi instead.": "",
  "Oh! It's you!": "",
  "Doctor": "",
  "Wrought with worry, I was, thinkin' what those joshi might've done to you..": "",
  "'Member me, the doctor?": "",
  "I heard your actions saved the girl.": "",
  "Fantastic stuff.": "",
  "You're a straight noble sort of guy. You know that?": "",
  "Oh! Sakamoto!": "",
  "Shimada Yahei": "",
  "It's me! Shimada Yahei!": "",
  "So I heard the news.": "",
  "Starting today, you're repping the Loyalist Party!": "",
  "Got me pretty excited for the future.": "",
  "The party gives hope to us goshi.": "",
  "Maybe I'll just call you Rep from now on, whaddaya think?": "",
  "You should know there are some who ain't amused by your little promotion, though.": "",
  "'Specially the party elders.": "",
  "Might wanna be careful walking around at night, just saying.": "",
  "'Course, they're your fellow party members, so prob'ly nothing'll happen.": "",
  "I have to say...": "",
  "You've gotten even stronger, am I right?": "",
  "I'm gonna need that strength.": "",
  "Come to think of it...": "",
  "It's been awhile since I walked with you like this.": "",
  "We used to run around here way back when, huh?": "",
  "Do you remember when we were kids and there\nwas that rainy day we went swimming in the river?": "",
  "Remember how much trouble you got in?\nYou lost your loincloth! Hahaha.": "",
  "Those were good times...": "",
  "How was training at Edo?": "",
  "Must've been some pretty tough characters out there, unlike here.": "",
  "You're tellin' me this is our Rep?": "",
  "He appears out of nowhere, and that's all it takes...": "",
  "Well, I won't accept it.": "",
  "There's only one man for the job.": "",
  "And if I were stronger than him...": "",
  "Takechi-sensei would've chosen me.": "",
  "Hmph... So it's you, hm?": "",
  "...I got a lot of vindictiveness in me.": "",
  "Don't you ever forget it.": "",
  "Rep, my ass.": "",
  "I'll refuse to accept it...": "",
  "Oh, by the way, Hajime-san...": "",
  "Might I ask you to pay the tab for your room?": "",
  "We don't want to set a precedent with the other customers, you know?": "",
  "I'm not asking for all of it at once, of course. I'm not some witch.": "",
  "Drinking till dawn, sleeping past noon...": "",
  "Must be a fun life you're living.": "",
  "Almost feel stupid for working all day and night.": "",
  "You're going to the gambling den again?": "",
  "And here I thought you'd be tired of it by now.": "",
  "I've never seen the appeal in gambling...": "",
  "Oh, but do let me know if you win.": "",
  "Then I'll know when to ask for your rent.": "",
  "Hitting the sake a little hard these days, don't you think?": "",
  "And I'll bet it's the cheap izakaya stuff, too, hm?": "",
  "It's not good for you, you know.": "",
  "I wouldn't want a guest of mine to make himself sick...": "",
  "Even Oryo-chan was worried about you.": "",
  "If you're looking for Oryo-chan...": "",
  "I sent her out on some errands.": "",
  "It was a bit of a long list, so she won't be back for a while.": "",
  "That Oryo-chan's such a nice girl.": "",
  "She's a hard worker, and a beauty to boot.": "",
  "Make a good wife, if you ask me.": "",
  "Wouldn't you agree, Hajime-san?": "",
  "Are you listening?": "",
  "Please, just watch out for the Shinsengumi, all right?": "",
  "Just carrying a sword around here can get you killed.": "",
  "We're even getting fewer guests because of them.": "",
  "I have to say I get jealous seeing guests from out of town.": "",
  "I've never once stepped outside of Kyo...": "",
  "Still, I hear so much about where they've been, it feels like I'm there.": "",
  "And that's enough for me.": "",
  "Are you going out?": "",
  "Please stay safe.": "",
  "You're back early.": "",
  "Welcome back.": "",
  "What should we do for tomorrow's menu?": "",
  "We got a lot of young folks today...": "",
  "Maybe I should ask Oryo-chan.": "",
  "That's good to go, and I asked Oryo-chan to take care of that...": "",
  "Umm, what's left?": "",
  "Oh, right, I had to do that...": "",
  "You're off to Mukurogai...?": "",
  "Why would you ever want to go somewhere so dangerous?": "",
  "You don't listen to a word I say, do you?": "",
  "Honestly, you're too much, Hajime-san.": "",
  "Why I even bother is beyond me.": "",
  "I'm busy too, you know...": "",
  "Back so early, and what do you do...?": "",
  "Hajime-san, what's gotten into you?": "",
  "You need to calm down too, Oryo-chan.": "",
  "I <i>am</i> calm!": "",
  "C'mon, Hajime-san!": "",
  "Are you seriously going to Mukurogai?": "",
  "You're really gonna do this?": "",
  "Idiot... They'll take everything you've got and leave you bleeding in the street! Do you hear me!?": "",
  "Oryo-chan, don't be so harsh on him.": "",
  "Don't make me say I told you so.": "",
  "Have you finally given up on going?": "",
  "Don't say I didn't warn you...": ""
 }
